### Regions
GET http://localhost:3001/api/geography/regions
Authorization: Bearer mock-token

### States
GET http://localhost:3001/api/geography/states
Authorization: Bearer mock-token

### States by region
GET http://localhost:3001/api/geography/states?region=WEST
Authorization: Bearer mock-token

### DMAs
GET http://localhost:3001/api/geography/dmas?state=NY
Authorization: Bearer mock-token

### Counties
GET http://localhost:3001/api/geography/counties?state=NY
Authorization: Bearer mock-token

### Search
GET http://localhost:3001/api/geography/search?q=California
Authorization: Bearer mock-token

### Revision geography
GET http://localhost:3001/api/programs/6/revisions/107/geography
Authorization: Bearer mock-token

### Update revision geography
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/programs/6/revisions/107/geography
Authorization: Bearer mock-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rules": [
    {
      "geoRuleId": 1,
      "isIncluded": true,
      "level": "STATE",
      "code": "NY",
      "name": "New York"
    }
  ]
}